{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-11","kind":"proposition","title":"两直线求别作一线相与为连比例","englishTitle":"To two given straight lines to find a third proportional.","book":6,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","contentId":"euclid-6-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08496bfecbe600d675d8e724a5c3469b4545a4417a762f5ee3dbbbb39204af52","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-11.statement","euclid-6-11.construction.1","euclid-6-11.construction.2","euclid-6-11.proof.1","euclid-6-11.proof.2","euclid-6-11.conclusion","euclid-6-11.historical.1","euclid-6-11.historical.2","euclid-6-11.historical.3","euclid-6-11.historical.4","euclid-6-11.historical.5","euclid-6-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56d3a73b47ffe2ccc253efc51d5ff7312678d6a6a1d7c3821d7991c3fe3a3daf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To two given straight lines to find a third proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找两条直线 找第三条成比例"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线求别作一线相与为连比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"通过画线分别找到两条直线并使其相互附着的比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89ded73bead8f170657020a723e376dc2bae5966ad5661405c84d61a4ed6d0a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BA, AC be the two given straight lines, and let them be placed so as to contain any angle; thus it is required to find a third proportional to BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BA,AC成为两条直线,并把它们放在任何角上;因此,需要找到第三个成比例至BA,AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acdd8ff4f341d4d9f2f0f1c1216477c84478426cf04979c1495a089316071d38","citations":["euclid-1-3","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let them be produced to the points D, E, and let BD be made equal to AC; [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] let BC be joined, and through D let DE be drawn parallel to it. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将其扩大到D、E点,BD点等于AC点;BC点连接,D点等于DE点等于AC点。 [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"207a9741b10f6ab00018285fcf52084a2219cff31b533f76991d29661e21fcef","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, BC has been drawn parallel to DE, one of the sides of the triangle ADE, proportionally, as AB is to BD, so is AC to CE. [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,BC三角形的侧面被划为DE,按比例而言,AB对BD比等于AC对CE；AB 与 BD 之比等于 AC 与 CE 之比。（相关点与线段：ADE） [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2b355d0a76bcb6288ba5a9e6edbfc042b2a1f63190d8a409e5a8644ae984de7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BD is equal to AC; therefore, as AB is to AC, so is AC to CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BD等于AC;因此,AB对AC的比等于AC对CE的比；AB 与 AC 之比等于 AC 与 CE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23f70d31c312eba74f19484b746d54b8d86203fa3da8cfdc10a361fa036caf59","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore to two given straight lines AB, AC a third proportional to them, CE, has been found. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现两条直线AB、AC、成比例直线,CE直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4341cda8d0c2911906591f1ae1e31fdcecc9cfdc91639936ebdf42d83fef4250","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线求别作一线相与为连比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"通过画线分别找到两条直线并使其相互附着的比例"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c6f57218d44252580957f0c9ecfa0d32d838491979f5af930a1294343b4fe02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：甲乙甲丙两线求别作一线相与为连比例者合两线任作甲角而甲乙与甲丙之比例若甲丙与他线也先于甲乙引长之为乙丁与甲丙等次作丙乙线相聨次从丁作丁戊线与丙乙平行末于甲丙引长之遇于戊即丙戊为所求线〈如以甲丙为前率仿此〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下：甲乙甲丙，找到两条线画一条分离的线并按比例连接它们；将两根线组合形成 甲 角。如果 甲乙 与 甲丙 的比例在 甲乙 之前也被延伸，乙丁 和 甲丙 被制作成 丙乙 线，那么从 丁 连接到 丁戊，与 丙乙 平行，并在 甲丙 延伸以在 戊 相交，即 丙戊 是所求的线 〈如以甲丙为前率仿此〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27e90a8ba737096531d967af12724dbf9daf9346ba42977069ac7227e0a7a48d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丁戊角形内之丙乙线既与戊丁边平行即甲乙与乙丁之比例若甲丙与丙戊也〈本篇二〉而乙丁甲丙元等即甲乙与甲丙若甲丙与丙戊也〈五卷七〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲丁戊，三角形内的线 丙乙 与 戊丁 的边平行，即 甲乙 与 乙丁 的比例。如果 甲丙 和 丙戊 也是 〈本篇二〉，并且 乙丁甲丙 等于 甲乙 和 甲丙，那么 甲丙 和 丙戊 也为 〈五卷七〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88e9d0f872b8f24465e207296785d199d47fbed5d7a49298ee3d867f293939b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：别有一法以甲乙乙丙两线列作甲乙丙直角次以甲丙线聨之而甲乙引长之末从丙作丙丁为甲丙之垂线遇引长线于丁即乙丁为所求线"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注意：另一种方法是将两条线 甲乙乙丙 排布成与 甲乙丙 成直角，然后用 甲丙 线连接它们。在 甲乙 延伸的末端，从 丙 画 丙丁 作为 甲丙 的垂线，当画出的线在 丁 与长线相交时，即 乙丁 是所需的线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e3e03852c5cc3950a8b143eb2ec2dd371e36e1e9de2c2fe12d7a627a4bc607f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丙丁角形之甲丙丁既为直角而从直角至甲丁底有丙乙垂线即丙乙为甲乙乙丁比例之中率〈本篇八之系〉则甲乙与乙丙若乙丙与乙丁也既从一二得三即从二三求四以上至于无穷俱仿此"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲丙丁，三角形 甲丙丁 为直角三角形，并从直角到 甲丁 的底边作垂线 丙乙，即 丙乙 是 甲乙乙丁 的中线比例。如果 〈本篇八之系〉 为 甲乙 和 乙丙，并且 乙丙 和 乙丁 从一到三获得，即从二到三，再到四及以上，都遵循相同的模式。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-11.source","contentId":"euclid-6-11","revisionId":"euclid-6-11@raw-08496bfecbe600d6","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"68a56c19fd434c6b7a1f220005258966fba8bb7eb646b96bf7cdcee8f0ec24aa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.11\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-11:euclid-1-3: